{"ao_id": "00000000000000000000000000061a97", "session_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc", "sequence": 23, "action": {"record_kind": "atom", "acl_labels": ["sb-skillsbench"], "segment_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc:agent", "participant_id": "agent", "transcript_type": "message", "block_kind": "tool_call", "truncated": false}, "observation": {"synopsis": "Wait, I made an error in the row mapping. Let me redo carefully. For exports rows 12-17, the MATCH series code uses $D12...$D17. Row 12 uses D12, row 13 uses D13, etc. So for each output row r in 12..17, series cell is D{r}. And year column c. Let me redo correctly."}, "skill_invocations": [], "message_ref": {"message_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc:22"}, "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z", "captured_state": "live"}
{"ao_id": "00000000000000000000000000061a98", "session_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc", "sequence": 24, "action": {"record_kind": "atom", "acl_labels": ["sb-skillsbench"], "segment_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc:agent", "participant_id": "agent", "transcript_type": "message", "block_kind": "tool_result", "truncated": false}, "observation": {"synopsis": "H12 =INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40,MATCH($D12,Data!$B$21:$B$40,0),MATCH(H$9,Data!$H$4:$M$4,0)) I12 =INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40,MATCH($D12,Data!$B$21:$B$40,0),MATCH(I$9,Data!$H$4:$M$4,0)) L12 =INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40,MATCH($D12,Data!$B$21:$B$40,0),MATCH(L$9,Data!$H$4:$M$4,0)) H19 =INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40,MATCH($D19,Data!$B$21:$B$40,0),MATCH(H$9,Data!$H$4:$M$4,0)) L24 =INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40,MATCH($D24,Data!$B$2"}, "skill_invocations": [], "message_ref": {"message_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc:23"}, "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z", "captured_state": "live"}
{"ao_id": "00000000000000000000000000061a99", "session_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc", "sequence": 25, "action": {"record_kind": "atom", "acl_labels": ["sb-skillsbench"], "segment_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc:agent", "participant_id": "agent", "transcript_type": "message", "block_kind": "tool_call", "truncated": false}, "observation": {"synopsis": "Now Step 2. Net exports % GDP in H35:L40. For each output cell (row r, column c): exports at (c,r-23), imports at (c,r-16), GDP at (c,r-9). Rows: H35 corresponds to H12(exports), H19(imports), H26(gdp) → row 12 = r-23=12 ✓, row 19 = r-16=19 ✓, row 26 = r-9=26 ✓. H36: exports H13, imports H20, gdp H27 → r-23=13 ✓, r-16=20 ✓, r-9=27 ✓. ... H40: exports H17, imports H24, gdp H31 ✓. So formula: `=(C{r"}, "skill_invocations": [], "message_ref": {"message_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc:24"}, "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z", "captured_state": "live"}
{"ao_id": "00000000000000000000000000061a9a", "session_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc", "sequence": 26, "action": {"record_kind": "atom", "acl_labels": ["sb-skillsbench"], "segment_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc:agent", "participant_id": "agent", "transcript_type": "message", "block_kind": "tool_result", "truncated": false}, "observation": {"synopsis": "H35 =(H12-H19)/H26*100 L35 =(L12-L19)/L26*100 H40 =(H17-H24)/H31*100 H42 =MIN(H35:H40) H46 =PERCENTILE.INC(H35:H40,0.25) L47 =PERCENTILE.INC(L35:L40,0.75) H50 =SUMPRODUCT(H35:H40,H26:H31)/SUM(H26:H31) L50 =SUMPRODUCT(L35:L40,L26:L31)/SUM(L26:L31)"}, "skill_invocations": [], "message_ref": {"message_id": "0005-sb-weighted-gdp-calc:25"}, "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z", "captured_state": "live"}
